A '''hyperlane''' connected [[Karfeddion]] in the [[Senex-Juvex]] [[sector]]s of the [[Mid Rim Territories]]<ref name="TFABG" /> to [[Eriadu]] in the [[Outer Rim Territories]], which was situated along the [[Rimma Trade Route]] at the junction of a number of major [[hyperspace route]]s. [[Unidentified Eiattu hyperlane|Another hyperlane]] branched off the route and headed north to the [[Eiattu system]] before joining the Rimma.<ref name="Map" /> 

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this hyperlane was known as the [[Senex Trace]] and was introduced in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

